WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.006 --> 00:00:08.008
[ominous music playing]

2
00:00:11.052 --> 00:00:13.054
[voices whispering]

3
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:21.074
Do you want subtitles for any video?
-=[ ai.OpenSubtitles.com ]=-

4
00:00:26.401 --> 00:00:28.361
[voices whispering]

5
00:00:44.836 --> 00:00:46.838
[poignant music playing]

6
00:01:02.562 --> 00:01:04.564
[thunder rumbling]

7
00:01:13.782 --> 00:01:15.075
[man] Your Majesty.

8
00:01:35.845 --> 00:01:40.767
THE EAST PALACE

9
00:01:40.850 --> 00:01:42.143
[music fades]

10
00:01:42.227 --> 00:01:46.606
[Saeng-gang] Yeom-mae? I can't hear you.
Can you please speak a little louder?

11
00:01:46.689 --> 00:01:47.816
[Gu-cheon sighs]

12
00:01:47.899 --> 00:01:50.026
Why is it so cramped in here?

13
00:01:50.110 --> 00:01:52.821
Is this really the only place
you could hide me?

14
00:01:52.904 --> 00:01:55.115
What am I. a kind of grub to you?

15
00:01:55.865 --> 00:01:57.158
What is he saying?

16
00:01:58.284 --> 00:02:01.496
[grunts] Come closer. And speak louder.

17
00:02:01.996 --> 00:02:03.123
Through this hole.

18
00:02:13.591 --> 00:02:15.552
-[Saeng-gang gasps]
-[Gu-cheon groans]

19
00:02:15.635 --> 00:02:20.098
-It's probably better that I quit now.
-[Saeng-gang] Would you stop complaining?

20
00:02:20.181 --> 00:02:22.851
You chose to stay in the palace
when I told you to run from here.

21
00:02:22.934 --> 00:02:25.854
[Gu-cheon] I stayed because I vowed
to save you. like you saved me.

22
00:02:25.937 --> 00:02:27.772
Now you're giving me a scolding?

23
00:02:27.856 --> 00:02:30.817
[Saeng-gang] I had to beg grandmother to
hide you. but with this complaining.

24
00:02:30.900 --> 00:02:33.653
I'm honestly about to lose
every bit of guilt and even appreciation

25
00:02:33.736 --> 00:02:34.821
I had for you.

26
00:02:34.904 --> 00:02:36.322
The yeom-mae…

27
00:02:41.161 --> 00:02:42.871
is somewhat difficult.

28
00:02:44.706 --> 00:02:46.666
so I lost my temper.

29
00:02:46.749 --> 00:02:48.793
So can you…

30
00:02:51.421 --> 00:02:54.090
tell me what a yeom-mae is?

31
00:02:55.508 --> 00:02:56.509
A curse ritual.

32
00:02:57.802 --> 00:02:59.554
A particularly vicious one.

33
00:02:59.637 --> 00:03:03.141
It's the act of creating a won-gwi
by sealing a person in a jar.

34
00:03:03.224 --> 00:03:04.893
[mysterious music playing]

35
00:03:04.976 --> 00:03:06.936
And then starving them to death.

36
00:03:07.896 --> 00:03:09.022
What if something goes wrong?

37
00:03:09.105 --> 00:03:12.942
Since I cannot enter the water
to become a spirit. this is the only way.

38
00:03:15.945 --> 00:03:17.488
If you accomplish this.

39
00:03:18.489 --> 00:03:20.533
can you get rid of
the spirit of the Crown Prince?

40
00:03:20.617 --> 00:03:22.660
[Gu-cheon] This wouldn't give me
that power.

41
00:03:22.744 --> 00:03:26.831
My soul would only be able to slip out
through this small hole in the wall.

42
00:03:28.666 --> 00:03:33.296
Instead. I will find a way to suppress
the power of the Crown Prince's spirit.

43
00:03:34.714 --> 00:03:36.090
Then I must…

44
00:03:37.967 --> 00:03:42.013
somehow manage to… to convince Father
to not kill you before then.

45
00:03:42.096 --> 00:03:43.389
[Gu-cheon] Do you think you can?

46
00:03:43.473 --> 00:03:46.643
What if you get thrown out after
raising your voice at the King again?

47
00:03:46.726 --> 00:03:48.728
Seeing as you both have vicious tempers.

48
00:03:48.811 --> 00:03:50.104
[Gu-cheon groans]

49
00:03:50.188 --> 00:03:53.316
Just make sure you don't
get yourself killed. will you. please.

50
00:03:54.359 --> 00:03:56.444
[Gu-cheon] You don't need
to worry. Princess.

51
00:03:56.527 --> 00:03:59.197
I don’t want you becoming my companion
in the afterlife

52
00:03:59.280 --> 00:04:00.990
just because you tried to help me.

53
00:04:01.074 --> 00:04:03.076
[poignant music playing]

54
00:04:11.292 --> 00:04:13.169
[Gu-cheon] All right. [sighs] Now.

55
00:04:13.253 --> 00:04:14.295
[tapping on wall]

56
00:04:14.379 --> 00:04:15.922
Please seal the hole.

57
00:04:43.574 --> 00:04:44.867
[inhales deeply]

58
00:05:13.980 --> 00:05:15.231
[door opens]

59
00:05:17.150 --> 00:05:18.276
[door closes]

60
00:05:20.737 --> 00:05:22.530
-[King] <i>Where is he now?</i>
-[music fades]

61
00:05:22.613 --> 00:05:24.699
I can't disclose his whereabouts.

62
00:05:25.742 --> 00:05:28.703
Not until you are willing to promise me
that you won't kill him.

63
00:05:28.786 --> 00:05:30.997
Now that Prince Yeongan is dead.

64
00:05:31.748 --> 00:05:33.958
his role in the palace has ended.

65
00:05:34.042 --> 00:05:36.919
We still need his help
since the spirit has not been dealt with.

66
00:05:37.003 --> 00:05:38.629
He has already failed us.

67
00:05:39.255 --> 00:05:42.675
I will not give another chance
to some incompetent. lazy bastard.

68
00:05:42.759 --> 00:05:45.678
You hid the truth about the spirit
and who he was truly dealing with.

69
00:05:47.347 --> 00:05:48.181
[scoffs]

70
00:05:48.765 --> 00:05:50.767
[tense music playing]

71
00:05:51.309 --> 00:05:53.436
You have to acknowledge
it all before it's too late.

72
00:05:53.519 --> 00:05:56.397
If you kill Gu-cheon to conceal
that the Crown Prince is the spirit.

73
00:05:56.481 --> 00:05:57.440
then very soon.

74
00:05:58.649 --> 00:06:00.401
we will share Prince Yeongan's fate.

75
00:06:03.946 --> 00:06:06.657
You are expelled
from the palace as of right now.

76
00:06:07.158 --> 00:06:09.744
-Leave here at once.
-That is not possible.

77
00:06:09.827 --> 00:06:13.706
If you disappear.
there will be no one left to help him.

78
00:06:14.874 --> 00:06:17.126
-Am I clear?
-So be it.

79
00:06:19.754 --> 00:06:22.340
Then I shall expose your shameful secrets
to the palace.

80
00:06:22.423 --> 00:06:24.634
How there was never a pond spirit
to begin with

81
00:06:24.717 --> 00:06:26.844
because the late King's son was murdered.

82
00:06:26.928 --> 00:06:28.554
Murdered by your hands. Father!

83
00:06:28.638 --> 00:06:30.640
[loud clattering]

84
00:06:31.224 --> 00:06:32.225
[Saeng-gang grunts]

85
00:06:33.726 --> 00:06:35.978
If you do not wish to die
as your mother did.

86
00:06:36.062 --> 00:06:37.814
never speak those words again.

87
00:06:37.897 --> 00:06:39.315
Do you understand?

88
00:06:40.358 --> 00:06:41.359
Now where is he?

89
00:06:42.860 --> 00:06:44.028
[Saeng-gang gasps]

90
00:06:45.029 --> 00:06:46.197
Tell me honestly.

91
00:06:48.032 --> 00:06:51.202
-Did my mother die at your hands too?
-I am asking you again.

92
00:06:51.702 --> 00:06:52.912
Where is Gu-cheon?

93
00:06:52.995 --> 00:06:54.705
I am asking you again. Father!

94
00:06:57.125 --> 00:06:58.918
Did you kill my mother?

95
00:06:59.919 --> 00:07:02.588
[Saeng-gang breathing shakily]

96
00:07:03.881 --> 00:07:05.633
-[King grunts]
-[Saeng-gang gasping]

97
00:07:07.677 --> 00:07:09.137
-Chief Eunuch!
-[gasps]

98
00:07:10.012 --> 00:07:12.473
[King] Confine the Princess
to her quarters immediately.

99
00:07:12.557 --> 00:07:14.892
and make sure she never steps outside.

100
00:07:15.560 --> 00:07:17.854
Ensure she's constantly watched.

101
00:07:22.358 --> 00:07:23.943
[music swells]

102
00:07:24.026 --> 00:07:26.028
[music fades]

103
00:07:30.158 --> 00:07:31.451
[labored breath]

104
00:07:32.743 --> 00:07:34.245
[munching]

105
00:07:35.163 --> 00:07:38.541
[Gu-cheon sighs]
That ungrateful little bastard.

106
00:07:38.624 --> 00:07:41.377
Stuffing its face all by itself.

107
00:07:41.461 --> 00:07:44.297
[squeaks. purrs]

108
00:07:51.596 --> 00:07:52.805
[groans]

109
00:07:53.514 --> 00:07:55.725
[labored breathing]

110
00:07:56.350 --> 00:07:58.352
[unsettling music playing]

111
00:08:03.441 --> 00:08:05.443
[unsettling percussive music playing]

112
00:08:08.237 --> 00:08:10.239
[labored breathing continues]

113
00:08:30.510 --> 00:08:32.512
[music intensifies]

114
00:08:49.654 --> 00:08:51.822
[Gu-cheon] <i>A deep. festering resentment</i>

115
00:08:52.406 --> 00:08:55.326
<i>has spread throughout the palace</i>
<i>in all directions.</i>

116
00:08:56.994 --> 00:09:00.164
<i>At this rate.</i>
<i>even the lives of the Princess.</i>

117
00:09:00.748 --> 00:09:02.333
<i>the King himself…</i>

118
00:09:02.416 --> 00:09:04.418
[music swells]

119
00:09:04.502 --> 00:09:06.003
[music subsides]

120
00:09:06.087 --> 00:09:08.506
<i>…and Royal Noble Consort Sukbin Choi.</i>

121
00:09:08.589 --> 00:09:11.717
<i>The Royal Noble Consort Sukbin Choi.</i>

122
00:09:19.850 --> 00:09:21.852
[tense percussive music playing]

123
00:09:26.107 --> 00:09:29.318
Why are you asking about the Crown Prince
who is deceased?

124
00:09:29.819 --> 00:09:33.864
[Gu-cheon] Is there anything left
of his belongings?

125
00:09:36.826 --> 00:09:39.287
[Sukbin] I hid you
because Saeng-gang asked me to.

126
00:09:39.370 --> 00:09:41.872
Have you called me here
just to spout nonsense?

127
00:09:41.956 --> 00:09:45.835
Your goal should be to destroy the spirit
tormenting His Majesty.

128
00:09:45.918 --> 00:09:47.336
Why would…

129
00:09:50.214 --> 00:09:53.634
the Crown Prince
have resentment toward His Majesty?

130
00:09:54.302 --> 00:09:55.428
You're saying

131
00:09:56.512 --> 00:09:58.681
that the one that is cursing us

132
00:09:59.557 --> 00:10:01.058
is the dead son of the late King?

133
00:10:01.142 --> 00:10:01.976
It cannot be.

134
00:10:02.059 --> 00:10:04.770
This explains why
His Majesty is looking for you.

135
00:10:04.854 --> 00:10:06.939
[Gu-cheon] Do you wish
to lose your granddaughter?

136
00:10:08.024 --> 00:10:09.650
If this continues.

137
00:10:11.235 --> 00:10:13.195
your son and granddaughter

138
00:10:14.572 --> 00:10:17.617
will end up vomiting blood
and die one by one.

139
00:10:20.453 --> 00:10:24.040
The villagers near Goyang-hyeon
are refusing to do mandatory labor.

140
00:10:24.123 --> 00:10:25.708
claiming illness?

141
00:10:27.918 --> 00:10:29.086
What illness is that?

142
00:10:29.170 --> 00:10:31.797
It appears to be nothing more
than a common cold. Your Majesty.

143
00:10:31.881 --> 00:10:35.468
Is it true that every able-bodied man
assigned to work has fallen ill?

144
00:10:35.551 --> 00:10:38.095
Illnesses like that
are very common in the village.

145
00:10:38.179 --> 00:10:40.389
due to the cold energy of the mountain.

146
00:10:40.890 --> 00:10:43.684
The issue. Your Majesty.
does not lie in the sick--

147
00:10:43.768 --> 00:10:46.687
Your Majesty.
the seat of the Crown Prince is vacant.

148
00:10:46.771 --> 00:10:50.691
I believe that you must anoint
a royal relative as our new Crown Prince--

149
00:10:50.775 --> 00:10:52.902
Are you really suggesting

150
00:10:54.195 --> 00:10:56.864
Prince Iksang's son
as our new Crown Prince?

151
00:10:57.657 --> 00:11:00.368
At the birthday banquet
for the Queen Dowager.

152
00:11:00.451 --> 00:11:02.453
did you not all see
how he fainted in front of her

153
00:11:02.536 --> 00:11:04.246
and then collapsed.
or did you all look away?

154
00:11:04.330 --> 00:11:07.249
Are you suggesting
I should anoint such a flawed child?

155
00:11:07.333 --> 00:11:09.960
It's too early
to impart the crown on anybody.

156
00:11:10.670 --> 00:11:12.672
My health is still good and strong.

157
00:11:13.172 --> 00:11:16.175
so never let such pathetic statements
leave your lips!

158
00:11:16.258 --> 00:11:17.677
[tense music continues]

159
00:11:26.143 --> 00:11:28.854
[voices screaming]

160
00:11:29.438 --> 00:11:30.898
[man 1] Your Majesty!

161
00:11:30.981 --> 00:11:32.983
[voices screaming]

162
00:11:34.610 --> 00:11:36.612
[squelching]

163
00:11:41.158 --> 00:11:43.160
[tense music swells]

164
00:11:47.081 --> 00:11:49.041
[music fades]

165
00:11:49.125 --> 00:11:51.419
[King breathing heavily]

166
00:11:51.502 --> 00:11:53.504
[ominous music playing]

167
00:12:11.605 --> 00:12:13.190
[wind whistles]

168
00:12:13.274 --> 00:12:15.276
[hinges creak]

169
00:12:36.255 --> 00:12:39.842
Such hubris.
thinking you can roam around so freely.

170
00:12:45.139 --> 00:12:46.307
Look at this.

171
00:12:52.146 --> 00:12:55.566
This Ikseongwan was prepared
just for Prince Yeongan.

172
00:12:57.568 --> 00:12:59.069
Now that child

173
00:13:00.488 --> 00:13:02.239
is no longer breathing.

174
00:13:03.699 --> 00:13:05.618
and you're the bastard to blame.

175
00:13:08.496 --> 00:13:13.042
I will stake everything that I possess
to hunt you down. I swear it.

176
00:13:15.294 --> 00:13:17.129
Because I will not be stopped…

177
00:13:21.467 --> 00:13:23.302
before I catch you.

178
00:13:23.385 --> 00:13:24.512
[loud thud]

179
00:13:32.686 --> 00:13:34.188
[music fades]

180
00:13:34.271 --> 00:13:35.648
[labored breathing]

181
00:13:36.941 --> 00:13:38.734
For goodness sake.

182
00:13:40.277 --> 00:13:41.821
I should have fled.

183
00:13:43.155 --> 00:13:45.866
[Iksang] The King is combing
through the palace. you say?

184
00:13:46.992 --> 00:13:49.954
Has he gone insane
now that his last son is dead?

185
00:13:50.454 --> 00:13:53.165
It seems he's searching
for the one named Gu-cheon.

186
00:13:54.375 --> 00:13:57.962
If he failed at his job.
he should've tried to get away.

187
00:13:58.045 --> 00:14:00.047
[distant music playing]

188
00:14:00.923 --> 00:14:02.925
[distant laughter]

189
00:14:08.681 --> 00:14:10.224
How are things over there?

190
00:14:12.810 --> 00:14:15.729
It's clear the spirit's power
has spread throughout the palace.

191
00:14:16.438 --> 00:14:18.148
Even I nearly fainted around it.

192
00:14:18.232 --> 00:14:19.859
[unsettling music playing]

193
00:14:19.942 --> 00:14:24.154
So even His Majesty's life is in danger.
dangling by a thread.

194
00:14:24.655 --> 00:14:27.032
But what troubles me is that Gu-cheon.

195
00:14:28.409 --> 00:14:31.245
I fear he'll become
the King's lifeline at some point.

196
00:14:35.082 --> 00:14:38.419
Then we should act fast
and cut that lifeline completely.

197
00:14:38.502 --> 00:14:39.420
should we not?

198
00:14:41.297 --> 00:14:42.840
[Iksang laughs]

199
00:14:44.300 --> 00:14:46.302
[music fades]

200
00:14:50.264 --> 00:14:51.515
[Chief Eunuch] Your Highness.

201
00:14:52.016 --> 00:14:54.518
His Majesty is urgently summoning
your audience.

202
00:14:55.853 --> 00:14:58.898
Was I not commanded
to not step outside my quarters?

203
00:14:58.981 --> 00:15:02.276
His Majesty will be leaving the palace
for a brief while.

204
00:15:03.611 --> 00:15:05.696
He would be happy to have your company.

205
00:15:05.779 --> 00:15:07.031
[door opens]

206
00:15:07.907 --> 00:15:09.909
[unsettling music playing]

207
00:15:29.595 --> 00:15:31.597
[unsettling music continues]

208
00:15:36.977 --> 00:15:38.020
[guard 1] Halt.

209
00:15:41.065 --> 00:15:43.192
-Check the surroundings.
-Yes. sir.

210
00:15:43.275 --> 00:15:44.151
[prods horse]

211
00:15:48.155 --> 00:15:49.281
[Chief Eunuch] Very well.

212
00:15:54.161 --> 00:15:55.287
Your Majesty.

213
00:15:56.789 --> 00:15:58.248
They look like refugees.

214
00:15:58.332 --> 00:16:00.793
Some elders and children
are among the lot.

215
00:16:01.293 --> 00:16:03.712
Their illness appears to have worsened
as they fled.

216
00:16:03.796 --> 00:16:05.923
leaving them no choice but to stay here.

217
00:16:06.006 --> 00:16:07.591
It is close to Goyang-hyeon.

218
00:16:07.675 --> 00:16:09.551
-I suggest we--
-I'll see myself.

219
00:16:09.635 --> 00:16:10.803
[Chief Eunuch] But Your Majes…

220
00:16:17.059 --> 00:16:19.061
[refugees crying]

221
00:16:27.569 --> 00:16:28.737
[child coughs]

222
00:16:37.788 --> 00:16:39.123
Goyang-hyeon…

223
00:16:41.333 --> 00:16:43.711
I will inspect the surrounding villages.

224
00:16:44.336 --> 00:16:46.213
And the memorial rite?

225
00:16:46.296 --> 00:16:47.589
We'll make a quick stop.

226
00:16:48.882 --> 00:16:52.302
Were you planning to go
to the late Crown Prince's grave?

227
00:16:54.013 --> 00:16:55.764
I will hold a rite there.

228
00:16:55.848 --> 00:16:58.851
Do you intend to kill Gu-cheon
using a memorial rite?

229
00:16:59.935 --> 00:17:01.311
That won't work. I promise you.

230
00:17:01.812 --> 00:17:04.648
You must spare his life
because you will need him soon.

231
00:17:04.732 --> 00:17:06.984
You two stay here
and help with the people.

232
00:17:07.484 --> 00:17:08.318
Let's move on.

233
00:17:09.903 --> 00:17:11.613
[horses snort]

234
00:17:12.698 --> 00:17:14.783
[tense music playing]

235
00:17:14.867 --> 00:17:16.869
[mosquitoes buzzing]

236
00:17:18.579 --> 00:17:19.580
[crow squawks]

237
00:17:19.663 --> 00:17:20.831
[refugee crying]

238
00:17:20.914 --> 00:17:22.166
[woman] Just try.

239
00:17:23.167 --> 00:17:24.251
[resident] Sir!

240
00:17:24.752 --> 00:17:26.712
Oh. wait. sir! Sir!

241
00:17:26.795 --> 00:17:29.339
Wait. sir. please.
Take a look at her. will you?

242
00:17:29.423 --> 00:17:31.050
Please. I beg you.

243
00:17:31.133 --> 00:17:32.176
Something is wrong.

244
00:17:32.259 --> 00:17:33.719
She's not responding at all.

245
00:17:33.802 --> 00:17:34.887
Please!

246
00:17:34.970 --> 00:17:36.680
What could be wrong with her. sir?

247
00:17:36.764 --> 00:17:37.973
Please help us.

248
00:17:38.557 --> 00:17:41.310
I am begging you. Could you look at her?

249
00:17:41.393 --> 00:17:42.811
I can't help her anymore.

250
00:17:42.895 --> 00:17:45.606
[resident] Oh. no. that can't be.
There must be something you can do.

251
00:17:45.689 --> 00:17:47.274
[sobs] My dear! My love!

252
00:17:47.357 --> 00:17:50.277
My love. open your eyes
and look at me. please!

253
00:17:50.360 --> 00:17:52.362
[resident crying]

254
00:17:53.489 --> 00:17:54.573
[sighs]

255
00:17:55.365 --> 00:17:56.909
It's a deadly illness.

256
00:17:56.992 --> 00:17:58.660
Is there some remedy?

257
00:17:59.203 --> 00:18:00.579
Something to combat this?

258
00:18:00.662 --> 00:18:02.498
Unfortunately not.

259
00:18:02.998 --> 00:18:05.125
I'm not even sure what it is.

260
00:18:05.793 --> 00:18:07.920
When one person falls ill.

261
00:18:08.003 --> 00:18:10.881
it spreads to the whole family
by the next day.

262
00:18:14.718 --> 00:18:18.680
Now the people will all have to boil
some peach branches to drink.

263
00:18:18.764 --> 00:18:21.141
They say a spirit brought the sickness.

264
00:18:21.225 --> 00:18:23.227
[tense music playing]

265
00:18:25.479 --> 00:18:26.730
[child] My lord!

266
00:18:26.814 --> 00:18:28.190
[sobs] My lord!

267
00:18:28.273 --> 00:18:29.483
[music fades]

268
00:18:30.234 --> 00:18:31.401
My lord!

269
00:18:31.485 --> 00:18:34.321
Will you please help save my father?
I beg of you. my lord.

270
00:18:35.030 --> 00:18:36.406
Like my brother…

271
00:18:38.283 --> 00:18:39.827
He's not breathing.

272
00:18:39.910 --> 00:18:40.911
Step back.

273
00:18:44.206 --> 00:18:46.041
[child] Forgive me. my lord.

274
00:18:46.667 --> 00:18:48.669
[unsettling music playing]

275
00:18:52.256 --> 00:18:54.258
[groaning]

276
00:18:58.428 --> 00:19:00.430
[child crying]

277
00:19:05.102 --> 00:19:06.478
I'm so scared.

278
00:19:11.150 --> 00:19:13.986
[King] Go with the child
and tend to her family right away.

279
00:19:14.486 --> 00:19:16.196
[guard] Yes. Your Majesty.

280
00:19:17.072 --> 00:19:18.073
Come with me.

281
00:19:24.163 --> 00:19:25.706
The illness is malignant

282
00:19:27.124 --> 00:19:28.709
and spreading quickly.

283
00:19:36.967 --> 00:19:38.552
We shall return at once.

284
00:19:39.303 --> 00:19:42.181
-What about the rite. Your Majesty?
-Postpone it.

285
00:19:42.681 --> 00:19:44.433
We must find a way to contain the illness.

286
00:19:44.516 --> 00:19:45.642
Wait.

287
00:19:46.435 --> 00:19:49.521
What about the villagers dying here.
Your Majesty?

288
00:19:50.022 --> 00:19:52.900
At this rate.
everybody in the kingdom is in danger.

289
00:19:53.650 --> 00:19:54.568
so hurry.

290
00:19:59.781 --> 00:20:01.450
-[prods horse]
-[horse neighs]

291
00:20:08.665 --> 00:20:10.667
[music fades]

292
00:20:12.961 --> 00:20:14.880
This is all I could gather.

293
00:20:15.881 --> 00:20:18.300
It's a poem written by the Crown Prince.

294
00:20:18.383 --> 00:20:21.261
Ever since he was young.
he would send me his poems in letters.

295
00:20:21.345 --> 00:20:22.221
[uneasy music playing]

296
00:20:22.304 --> 00:20:25.891
Now that's the only remaining item
of the Crown Prince's belongings.

297
00:20:29.937 --> 00:20:31.188
[Gu-cheon] Wonderful.

298
00:20:32.689 --> 00:20:35.609
Now you have to do exactly what I say.

299
00:20:36.610 --> 00:20:38.695
[tense percussive music playing]

300
00:20:41.073 --> 00:20:42.783
[Gu-cheon]
<i>Go to the Crown Prince's office.</i>

301
00:20:43.492 --> 00:20:45.327
<i>remove the door handle.</i>

302
00:20:45.827 --> 00:20:47.829
<i>and post his poem on the door.</i>

303
00:20:50.791 --> 00:20:54.086
<i>You must seal it</i>
<i>to keep the Crown Prince's power</i>

304
00:20:54.169 --> 00:20:55.921
<i>from growing any stronger.</i>

305
00:21:06.765 --> 00:21:10.602
[Iksang] <i>Go to the palace and find</i>
<i>where that bastard Gu-cheon is hiding.</i>

306
00:21:12.562 --> 00:21:15.065
[shaman] <i>I'll begin with</i>
<i>the places he has already been</i>

307
00:21:15.148 --> 00:21:16.650
<i>and trace his steps.</i>

308
00:21:18.193 --> 00:21:21.280
<i>Even the smallest trace</i>
<i>will lead me to him.</i>

309
00:21:32.416 --> 00:21:39.381
[whistling]

310
00:21:39.464 --> 00:21:42.259
[music swells. subsides]

311
00:21:46.680 --> 00:21:47.514
There he is.

312
00:21:47.597 --> 00:21:49.599
[dark ominous music playing]

313
00:21:52.269 --> 00:21:53.854
[door rattling]

314
00:22:03.822 --> 00:22:07.534
[shrieking screams]

315
00:22:11.496 --> 00:22:13.290
[horse neighs]

316
00:22:16.626 --> 00:22:18.462
[guard] We have found where he's hiding.

317
00:22:18.545 --> 00:22:20.130
[Chief Eunuch] Very well. Your Majesty.

318
00:22:22.466 --> 00:22:23.800
They have found Gu-cheon.

319
00:22:24.301 --> 00:22:26.303
[pensive ethereal music playing]

320
00:22:28.430 --> 00:22:29.473
Kill him.

321
00:22:29.973 --> 00:22:31.808
-[tense music playing]
-No. please don't.

322
00:22:32.392 --> 00:22:33.977
You must not do this. Father.

323
00:22:34.478 --> 00:22:35.896
He is necessary.

324
00:22:35.979 --> 00:22:37.689
Please. Father! Listen to me!

325
00:22:37.773 --> 00:22:39.775
You have to spare him!

326
00:22:39.858 --> 00:22:41.151
Father! Wait!

327
00:22:42.819 --> 00:22:43.904
[guard] He's in here.

328
00:22:47.657 --> 00:22:49.368
-[guard grunts]
-[Gu-cheon gasps]

329
00:22:49.451 --> 00:22:50.952
[groaning]

330
00:22:51.036 --> 00:22:53.080
[grunting]

331
00:22:53.163 --> 00:22:54.039
[guard] Come out!

332
00:22:54.122 --> 00:22:55.749
[grunts. groans]

333
00:22:56.875 --> 00:22:58.877
[screaming]

334
00:23:01.088 --> 00:23:02.923
[grunts. groans]

335
00:23:07.803 --> 00:23:09.805
[voices screaming]

336
00:23:09.888 --> 00:23:11.890
[squelching]

337
00:23:13.308 --> 00:23:14.768
No. No.

338
00:23:15.352 --> 00:23:16.478
[breathing nervously]

339
00:23:16.561 --> 00:23:18.563
[tense music continues]

340
00:23:20.607 --> 00:23:22.234
[Gu-cheon grunts. groans]

341
00:23:23.610 --> 00:23:24.569
[grunts]

342
00:23:28.573 --> 00:23:30.575
[breathing heavily]

343
00:23:30.659 --> 00:23:31.993
Let go of me.

344
00:23:33.245 --> 00:23:34.329
I said let go of me!

345
00:23:36.081 --> 00:23:37.124
[groans]

346
00:23:39.000 --> 00:23:40.836
[Chief Eunuch] Heavens! How rash of you.

347
00:23:42.796 --> 00:23:44.798
[Gu-cheon groans]

348
00:23:46.633 --> 00:23:48.009
The Buddha is watching.

349
00:23:48.969 --> 00:23:50.887
Take him somewhere out of sight.

350
00:23:50.971 --> 00:23:52.681
[Gu-cheon breathes shakily]

351
00:23:52.764 --> 00:23:54.850
[Gu-cheon laughing]

352
00:23:59.646 --> 00:24:00.647
Everyone will die.

353
00:24:00.730 --> 00:24:02.774
Have you lost
your mind now that death is near?

354
00:24:02.858 --> 00:24:06.153
[Gu-cheon] He will die. He will… [laughs]

355
00:24:07.404 --> 00:24:09.406
[laughing continues]

356
00:24:11.199 --> 00:24:13.160
What are you muttering to yourself there?

357
00:24:13.243 --> 00:24:15.245
[Gu-cheon breathes heavily]

358
00:24:16.329 --> 00:24:18.707
The King is going to die very soon.

359
00:24:19.624 --> 00:24:22.210
[music swells. fades]

360
00:24:32.804 --> 00:24:33.638
[coughs]

361
00:24:34.264 --> 00:24:35.432
[coughing]

362
00:24:37.809 --> 00:24:39.811
[tense music playing]

363
00:24:43.273 --> 00:24:44.399
[Chief Eunuch] Where is he?

364
00:24:44.483 --> 00:24:47.152
He's inside. Is something wrong?

365
00:24:48.195 --> 00:24:49.279
Your Majesty.

366
00:24:54.910 --> 00:24:55.911
Your Majesty.

367
00:24:56.786 --> 00:24:58.288
-Your Majesty!
-[music swells]

368
00:24:58.371 --> 00:25:00.415
-[guard 1] Your Majesty!
-[guard 2] Your Majesty!

369
00:25:02.292 --> 00:25:04.169
-Your Majesty.
-Your Majesty.

370
00:25:06.087 --> 00:25:07.797
-[woman] Your Majesty!
-He's not responding.

371
00:25:07.881 --> 00:25:09.341
Send for the royal physician!

372
00:25:09.841 --> 00:25:12.093
-Fetch him now!
-[woman] Yes. sir.

373
00:25:12.177 --> 00:25:13.303
[Chief Eunuch] Your Majesty.

374
00:25:13.803 --> 00:25:14.721
Your Majesty.

375
00:25:15.222 --> 00:25:16.681
-Your Majesty.
-[music fades]

376
00:25:16.765 --> 00:25:20.352
[Queen labored] You mean to tell me
that the King is dying?

377
00:25:20.435 --> 00:25:22.395
Rumors have spread throughout the palace

378
00:25:22.479 --> 00:25:25.357
that His Majesty will not make it
through the night.

379
00:25:25.440 --> 00:25:27.442
[uneasy music playing]

380
00:25:28.610 --> 00:25:31.279
[Queen] Does this mean
that the King's bloodline

381
00:25:31.363 --> 00:25:33.532
is going to be severed…

382
00:25:35.617 --> 00:25:40.205
as foretold
by that malevolent ghost's curse?

383
00:25:41.748 --> 00:25:42.582
[Jang] What?

384
00:25:43.083 --> 00:25:46.670
Your… Your Majesty. what do you mean?

385
00:25:49.756 --> 00:25:53.718
Go and send a man
to collect Prince Iksang.

386
00:25:55.929 --> 00:25:57.180
[music fades]

387
00:26:00.350 --> 00:26:01.601
[Saeng-gang] This is karma.

388
00:26:03.311 --> 00:26:06.940
You may consider this your comeuppance
for every one of your evil deeds.

389
00:26:09.150 --> 00:26:11.653
For the ones you committed
30 years ago. Father.

390
00:26:17.492 --> 00:26:19.911
[wistful music playing]

391
00:26:52.777 --> 00:26:54.821
I want you to tell me where he is.

392
00:26:56.197 --> 00:26:58.199
[music turns tense]

393
00:27:09.502 --> 00:27:11.463
Why are you standing around?

394
00:27:12.422 --> 00:27:13.923
Go untie him now!

395
00:27:14.007 --> 00:27:15.258
[Chief Eunuch] Untie him.

396
00:27:22.557 --> 00:27:24.559
[Saeng-gang breathing heavily]

397
00:27:26.394 --> 00:27:27.520
[Saeng-gang exhales sharply]

398
00:27:27.604 --> 00:27:29.606
[Gu-cheon groaning]

399
00:27:33.068 --> 00:27:35.236
You came here so quickly.

400
00:27:35.320 --> 00:27:36.529
[Saeng-gang] Yes. I did.

401
00:27:37.280 --> 00:27:38.907
You've been beaten bloody.

402
00:27:39.491 --> 00:27:41.326
[Gu-cheon] If the King has collapsed.

403
00:27:42.911 --> 00:27:45.664
it must mean that you're not safe either.

404
00:27:47.415 --> 00:27:48.583
Are you all right?

405
00:27:51.336 --> 00:27:53.463
Yes. thank you. I'm fine now.

406
00:27:55.882 --> 00:27:57.175
There is something.

407
00:27:58.510 --> 00:28:00.970
My father's grave condition
is not getting better.

408
00:28:01.763 --> 00:28:04.849
Is there any way to banish the spirit
to save His Majesty?

409
00:28:04.933 --> 00:28:06.518
[music fades]

410
00:28:07.268 --> 00:28:08.561
There is a way.

411
00:28:09.062 --> 00:28:11.523
The Crown Prince's body.

412
00:28:11.606 --> 00:28:12.857
That's how.

413
00:28:12.941 --> 00:28:14.943
[tense music playing]

414
00:28:20.198 --> 00:28:21.366
[Gu-cheon groans]

415
00:28:28.456 --> 00:28:29.541
[groans]

416
00:28:38.800 --> 00:28:40.385
Bring the Crown Prince here.

417
00:28:41.052 --> 00:28:43.221
Go and get him from the tomb at once.

418
00:28:43.304 --> 00:28:45.432
Do you realize what you're asking of me?

419
00:28:45.515 --> 00:28:48.560
There is no time.
It must be done to save my father.

420
00:28:49.602 --> 00:28:52.522
But we cannot desecrate a royal tomb.
Your Highness.

421
00:28:52.605 --> 00:28:53.690
That would be high treason--

422
00:28:53.773 --> 00:28:56.860
I will bear any and all consequences
for this as the Princess. Understand?

423
00:28:58.486 --> 00:28:59.612
And once Father awakens.

424
00:28:59.696 --> 00:29:02.741
I will accept punishment
for disgracing the royal house.

425
00:29:03.241 --> 00:29:04.617
I promise you that.

426
00:29:09.289 --> 00:29:12.917
[Gu-cheon] <i>To drive out the spirit.</i>
<i>we need the Crown Prince's body.</i>

427
00:29:14.919 --> 00:29:18.965
<i>But we must not let the spirit notice us.</i>

428
00:29:20.300 --> 00:29:22.719
<i>We will have to fool its eyes</i>
<i>with a dead animal.</i>

429
00:29:26.097 --> 00:29:28.475
<i>If we fail to drive it off before dawn…</i>

430
00:29:30.977 --> 00:29:33.563
<i>the King is fated to die.</i>

431
00:29:33.646 --> 00:29:35.940
<i>So we must hurry.</i>

432
00:29:36.024 --> 00:29:40.779
<i>All that remains is for me</i>
<i>to strike down the spirit with my blade.</i>

433
00:29:41.446 --> 00:29:43.448
[music fades]

434
00:29:47.660 --> 00:29:51.414
But with the state your body's in.
is it possible?

435
00:29:51.915 --> 00:29:55.293
My body's like a rag.
but I can still cut just fine.

436
00:29:57.629 --> 00:29:58.880
[sighs]

437
00:30:00.298 --> 00:30:03.843
Thanks to the King collapsing back there.
I get to enjoy the fresh air once more.

438
00:30:03.927 --> 00:30:06.429
Are you joking. even at a time like this?

439
00:30:07.096 --> 00:30:10.183
So. remember what I told you to do.

440
00:30:13.853 --> 00:30:15.480
Do not worry about me.

441
00:30:16.731 --> 00:30:18.733
And make sure to unfurrow that brow.

442
00:30:19.234 --> 00:30:20.944
[poignant music playing]

443
00:30:21.611 --> 00:30:22.529
Gu-cheon.

444
00:30:32.789 --> 00:30:34.374
You told me before

445
00:30:35.834 --> 00:30:38.586
that your own life matters
more than anything.

446
00:30:40.171 --> 00:30:42.423
That you don't wanna die
and become an ak-gwi.

447
00:30:43.383 --> 00:30:45.260
And I still feel the same way.

448
00:30:50.682 --> 00:30:52.016
That's all I need to hear.

449
00:30:57.772 --> 00:30:59.774
[water splashing]

450
00:31:03.862 --> 00:31:04.946
And Gu-cheon.

451
00:31:07.532 --> 00:31:09.742
Don't throw your life away because of me.

452
00:31:13.329 --> 00:31:15.039
That goes without saying.

453
00:31:22.213 --> 00:31:23.882
[music swells]

454
00:31:23.965 --> 00:31:25.967
[ominous music playing]

455
00:31:29.596 --> 00:31:31.598
[squelching]

456
00:31:45.111 --> 00:31:46.237
[Gu-cheon exhales]

457
00:31:51.868 --> 00:31:53.620
[Crown Prince sighs]

458
00:31:59.542 --> 00:32:01.085
[Gu-cheon grunting]

459
00:32:01.169 --> 00:32:03.296
[tense dramatic music playing]

460
00:32:04.672 --> 00:32:05.673
[grunts]

461
00:32:06.299 --> 00:32:07.300
[groans]

462
00:32:08.301 --> 00:32:09.719
-[grunts]
-[gasps]

463
00:32:12.180 --> 00:32:13.389
[coughs]

464
00:32:17.894 --> 00:32:19.896
[dramatic percussive music playing]

465
00:32:22.523 --> 00:32:24.275
[Gu-cheon] <i>When I start fighting.</i>

466
00:32:25.693 --> 00:32:29.948
<i>you must use this blood-soaked rope</i>
<i>to bind the Crown Prince's body tightly.</i>

467
00:32:31.616 --> 00:32:33.493
Lock the door with the rope.

468
00:32:34.702 --> 00:32:36.245
And no matter what happens.

469
00:32:37.747 --> 00:32:39.749
<i>do not open it for anyone.</i>

470
00:32:39.832 --> 00:32:41.334
<i>You must remember this.</i>

471
00:32:44.420 --> 00:32:45.713
<i>If I fail.</i>

472
00:32:47.507 --> 00:32:49.509
<i>you will be the next target.</i>

473
00:32:50.093 --> 00:32:51.010
[gasps]

474
00:32:52.345 --> 00:32:53.429
[Gu-cheon grunts]

475
00:32:55.598 --> 00:32:56.724
[both grunt]

476
00:32:59.978 --> 00:33:01.229
[Gu-cheon groans. grunts]

477
00:33:01.312 --> 00:33:04.649
Do not interfere.

478
00:33:11.030 --> 00:33:13.032
[rope whooshes]

479
00:33:14.409 --> 00:33:16.285
[Crown Prince] Do not get in the way.

480
00:33:17.286 --> 00:33:19.789
The King's bloodline shall end tonight.

481
00:33:20.915 --> 00:33:22.709
I won't let that happen.

482
00:33:23.418 --> 00:33:26.629
There is someone else here in this palace
I must save.

483
00:33:26.713 --> 00:33:28.715
[tense dramatic music playing]

484
00:33:35.179 --> 00:33:37.557
[gasps. gurgles]

485
00:33:39.726 --> 00:33:41.936
[Crown Prince panting]

486
00:33:43.980 --> 00:33:45.189
[choking]

487
00:33:49.902 --> 00:33:51.279
[choking]

488
00:33:58.327 --> 00:34:00.371
It's all over for you now.

489
00:34:02.206 --> 00:34:03.833
[grunts]

490
00:34:10.339 --> 00:34:11.924
[Gu-cheon] What is that?

491
00:34:12.008 --> 00:34:14.927
[breathing heavily]

492
00:34:15.011 --> 00:34:17.430
That doesn't look like a gwi-mae.

493
00:34:19.182 --> 00:34:21.517
Good heavens. this is unbelievable.

494
00:34:22.643 --> 00:34:24.687
Whose guardian spirit is this?

495
00:34:25.188 --> 00:34:27.356
Who dares to interfere?

496
00:34:27.440 --> 00:34:29.442
[percussive music playing]

497
00:34:36.449 --> 00:34:37.408
[Iksang] <i>Fine.</i>

498
00:34:37.909 --> 00:34:39.494
<i>Let us see how formidable</i>

499
00:34:39.577 --> 00:34:42.747
<i>the guardian spirit</i>
<i>you claim to serve truly is.</i>

500
00:34:43.456 --> 00:34:45.541
<i>Show me its power.</i>

501
00:34:46.125 --> 00:34:49.003
[shaman chanting]

502
00:34:49.504 --> 00:34:51.506
[snarling]

503
00:34:56.719 --> 00:34:58.012
Where did he go?

504
00:34:59.097 --> 00:35:00.139
[pants]

505
00:35:00.890 --> 00:35:03.768
[groaning]

506
00:35:08.689 --> 00:35:10.650
[growls]

507
00:35:18.783 --> 00:35:19.951
[grunts]

508
00:35:20.034 --> 00:35:22.495
[percussive music continues]

509
00:35:22.578 --> 00:35:25.373
[boisterous screaming. laughing]

510
00:35:25.456 --> 00:35:27.041
-[music turns tense]
-[grunts]

511
00:35:28.709 --> 00:35:31.129
[boisterous screaming. laughing]

512
00:35:32.755 --> 00:35:34.298
[squelching]

513
00:35:37.677 --> 00:35:38.886
[screaming]

514
00:35:38.970 --> 00:35:40.638
[music intensifies]

515
00:35:40.721 --> 00:35:44.142
[boisterous screaming. laughing]

516
00:35:46.519 --> 00:35:48.437
[both grunting]

517
00:35:50.273 --> 00:35:52.024
[boisterous scream]

518
